<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4650 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4650 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4650 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.3400 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 27		 June 26</p>
<p> High			     75.4800		 75.5000</p>
<p> Low				75.4000		 75.3400</p>
<p> Open			     75.4500		 75.5000</p>
<p> Close			    75.4650		 75.3400</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    6.300		   3.965</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
